{"type":"thought","data":"This is a status-only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" request. I will run"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the multi-host-runtime"}
{"type":"thought","data":" status command and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"report the session environment"}
{"type":"thought","data":" variable state."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check if GROK_SESSION_ID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is set. I need to find"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the task and dispatch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" IDs in environment "}
{"type":"thought","data":"variables to emit worker_done."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI need to verify the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact final message"}
{"type":"thought","data":" format. The worker_done"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message is separate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the status line."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will search for how"}
{"type":"thought","data":" status output should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be printed.\n\nI am checking the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"state schema and resume"}
{"type":"thought","data":" decision logic to understand"}
{"type":"thought","data":" how status is read."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The final line must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contain JSON-encoded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" last_completed_phase"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and halt_reason, with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" null for absent values."}
{"type":"thought","data":" No edits are allowed.\n\nI will run read-only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" checks for install,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" hook wiring, and state"}
{"type":"thought","data":" validation. Missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" files will be reported"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as unmet rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" created. I will print"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the state from docs/.bkit-memory.json"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and surface stale phase=step5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flags. HMAD_HOST=grok"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must be passed inline"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on every h-mad script"}
{"type":"thought","data":" call without exporting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it.\n\nI realized that running"}
{"type":"thought","data":" install check and hook"}
{"type":"thought","data":" wiring under status"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would trigger bootstrap"}
{"type":"thought","data":" writes, which violates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the no-edits rule. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"I will skip those checks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entirely and only report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the state directly."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will use the parameter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" expansion `${GROK_SESSION_ID+x}`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to check whether GROK_SESSION_ID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is set, including empty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" values. The grok adapter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identifies this as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the session-id-env variable."}
